            "detailed_description": "<h1>Switching the language</h1><p>If you want to change the language settings, you can do it by going to the STEAM Library, right clicking on the game and then selecting Properties. Under Properties, click on Language tab, and you'll be able to choose the language you like.<br><br>*Please note that if you load the previous save files after switching to other languages, in-game texts may not be displayed properly, due to different font usage. Therefore, we highly recommend that you start a new game if language setting has been changed from STEAM Properties.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>In the near future, androids have become the way of the norm. Emotionless husks of metal have become a part of human society, much to the dismay of the boy. The robot he found at the dumpsite though, this one was different. It laughed, it cried, it smiled, it has dreams, just like a human…<br><br>Lucy -The Eternity She Wished For- is a Visual Novel, about a boy and an android. You play as the boy, who faces decisions and moral dilemmas in this near-future world. This is a story that has touched many hearts and continues to have a strong impact on those who partake in this compelling journey.<br><br><br><br><strong>About Developers :<br><br>Project Director / Scenario : S.R<br><br>Character CG / UI Design : Defender<br><br>If you have any question or request regarding our product, please contact at <a href=\"mailto:mvizlab@gmail.com\">mvizlab@gmail.com</a> :)</strong>",
            "about_the_game": "In the near future, androids have become the way of the norm. Emotionless husks of metal have become a part of human society, much to the dismay of the boy. The robot he found at the dumpsite though, this one was different. It laughed, it cried, it smiled, it has dreams, just like a human…<br><br>Lucy -The Eternity She Wished For- is a Visual Novel, about a boy and an android. You play as the boy, who faces decisions and moral dilemmas in this near-future world. This is a story that has touched many hearts and continues to have a strong impact on those who partake in this compelling journey.<br><br><br><br><strong>About Developers :<br><br>Project Director / Scenario : S.R<br><br>Character CG / UI Design : Defender<br><br>If you have any question or request regarding our product, please contact at <a href=\"mailto:mvizlab@gmail.com\">mvizlab@gmail.com</a> :)</strong>",
            "short_description": "If there was a robot that could laugh, cry and smile. ...Does it have a soul?",
